  "_comment": "Curated sub-team composition, keyed by domain. Each entry emits ONE teams/<id>.json payload + one registry entry. Member ids must match the `id` field inside src/agency/<domain>/*.json. Tones are limited to the 6 the UI supports: indigo, emerald, sky, rose, amber, violet. Domains with no entry fall back to one flat team per domain. Large domains (engineering 59, specialized 58, marketing 36) MUST stay composed: a lead persona concatenates every member contract, so a 59-member lead would blow the context window."
}
